00:08:43.563 --> 00:08:45.164
I'M SAYING NOTHING.

00:08:45.165 --> 00:08:46.098
&gt;&gt; Dana: MY HEIGHT.

00:08:46.099 --> 00:08:49.001
THERE IS A MISTAKE ON MINE.

00:08:49.002 --> 00:08:49.668
NOT BECAUSE I SORT OF --

00:08:49.669 --> 00:08:51.637
EXAGGERATED.

00:08:51.638 --> 00:08:52.805
THERE IS A TYPO.

00:08:52.806 --> 00:08:57.409
AND IT'S PRETTY FUNNY.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:59.411
&gt;&gt; Juan: HOW LONG DOES IT LAST?

00:08:59.412 --> 00:09:00.045
&gt;&gt; Greg: I DON'T KNOW.

00:09:00.046 --> 00:09:01.013
FIVE YEARS?

00:09:01.014 --> 00:09:03.116
&gt;&gt; 10.

